{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_chat_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "56b8fd52c49efafdc02642b37983efbb3ac00060ce61f8bae8a498c48b18a25a", "ja": "うーん、\n{$P$}Pさんは\nどこかな～？", "zh": "唔～\n{$P$}P先生\n上哪去了呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_chat_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "d143798fda494c6fd57c70205d150de42204197dc0d2f8737b3c366727c9720c", "ja": "社長さんが新曲が来た！\nって、はりきってたのに……", "zh": "社长可是嚷着：「新歌来了！」，\n整个人非常振奋的说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_chat_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "4710f63a348a360fa0f8b4d9eb5821a57f0e383c2c020bb44eeb6bc705a04231", "ja": "それにしても、今日はジメジメして\n暑いなぁ。こんなに暑いと、みんな\nもバテちゃって大変なことに……。", "zh": "不过话说回来，今天好潮湿闷热喔。\n在这么热的天气下，\n要是大家热坏了可就糟了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_chat_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "f0d1df350c4b2460517cb0cfb532c6e707023ef8c12720fab95bf12818ce6936", "ja": "あっ、倉庫に除湿器があったはず！\nあとで持ってこよ～っと♪", "zh": "啊，我记得仓库里应该有除湿机！\n待会去拿过来吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
